{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_8884f29d1726d1e73b8999f7cf01cc19927c0e1c0fdbdbc27387525ee8f1ba7a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"buildContext substitutes {{key}} placeholders in templates with string values from the agent state."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b287b4de7a75e9387c63bf06e93a9e4044a2af33d96872883ca83c662a713f43"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"formatPersonality renders an IAgentPersonality into prompt sections: Identity, Biography, Background Lore, Personality Style, and Rules."}],"claim_ids":["clm_8884f29d1726d1e73b8999f7cf01cc19927c0e1c0fdbdbc27387525ee8f1ba7a","clm_b287b4de7a75e9387c63bf06e93a9e4044a2af33d96872883ca83c662a713f43"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_48578a3826854be4a88b73a827ea21b3","id":"pg_4e2bc557a29d574281a67a0e94caf163","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/bombap-tiny-agent-src-context-ts-58ecae062ec6-7a0e94caf163.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_eb2a7e10e9255dae99c9a37c64b25e09"],"title":"bombap/tiny-agent/src/context.ts @ 58ecae062ec6","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_48578a3826854be4a88b73a827ea21b3"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_27543b930701c920272a3b40b09909e94d0831ca67bb9b24d05503bb88d6a7f6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The scratchpad is capped at 33 steps (oldest trimmed) and the message buffer at 33 messages with oldest-message eviction."},{"claim_ids":["clm_77e00c46cd02a6f9d08325b5d0bc0b50619912d6994148731918f78d584db585"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A ReactAgentRuntime class implements IAgentRuntime, holding an LLMEngine, tools, providers, clients, state, and a message buffer."},{"claim_ids":["clm_86f277892e2f2221b21f5e995766cdb9f650b7a75d06db8aaee5d39ac928ab52"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime provides public methods to add clients, tools and providers, merge state updates, and disconnect all registered clients."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9b9395caa51b0c884f89e569ffc219122b021a5f0128953bb7d9258eafb9c376"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each step builds a context from a React template and a system prompt from a personality template, generates text via the LLM engine, and parses a JSON block from the response."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ce1fbfb04a9709b6aa96cf5679f538def96df57b59f027a9981ae973bdb03a53"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Parsed responses append Thought/Action/Observation entries to a scratchpad; actions are matched to tools by name and executed with the action input, with unknown tools logged as an observation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_efd654a61f1bab9ba1b02582a6721c5b905b9d2071e2fbf0ad403f3b6407e6c4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime loops calling _step() until state.completed is set; with SAFE_MODE enabled it stops after MAX_STEPS steps (default 20 from the MAX_STEPS env var)."}],"claim_ids":["clm_27543b930701c920272a3b40b09909e94d0831ca67bb9b24d05503bb88d6a7f6","clm_77e00c46cd02a6f9d08325b5d0bc0b50619912d6994148731918f78d584db585","clm_86f277892e2f2221b21f5e995766cdb9f650b7a75d06db8aaee5d39ac928ab52","clm_9b9395caa51b0c884f89e569ffc219122b021a5f0128953bb7d9258eafb9c376","clm_ce1fbfb04a9709b6a